## 二、基础改良设施

### 农场 (Farm)

| 属性 | 内容 |
|-----|------|
| **解锁** | 灌溉 |
| **位置** | 草原/平原（非丘陵），或资源（稻米/小麦/玉米） |
| **基础产出** | +1 粮食 |
| **额外产出** | 封建主义：相邻2+农场+1粮食；可替换零件：+1粮食 |
| **特殊** | 在泛滥平原可建造（不移除地貌） |

```typescript
const FARM: Improvement = {
  id: 'farm',
  name: '农场',
  unlockedBy: 'irrigation',
  buildTime: 1,
  validTerrains: [TerrainType.GRASSLAND, TerrainType.PLAINS],
  validFeatures: [FeatureType.FLOODPLAINS],
  validElevations: [Elevation.FLAT],
  requiredResource: ['rice', 'wheat', 'maize'], // 可选
  baseYields: { food: 1 },
  bonusYields: [
    { unlockedBy: 'feudalism', yields: { food: 1 } }, // 相邻2+农场
    { unlockedBy: 'replaceable_parts', yields: { food: 1 } },
  ],
  adjacencyBonus: [{
    adjacent: 'farm',
    yields: { food: 0.5 }, // 2个相邻农场=+1粮食
  }],
  removesFeature: [FeatureType.MARSH],
  pillageYield: { type: 'healing', amount: 50 },
};
```

